{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/b7acad6e34f7b7ee1d69ba34a8e5ddff.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/b7acad6e34f7b7ee1d69ba34a8e5ddff.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/b7acad6e34f7b7ee1d69ba34a8e5ddff.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shardbreakers</strong></i><strong> is a fast-paced bullet-hell twin-stick action roguelike where you craft your own Magic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Breakers have shattered the First Light - the origin of all creation - and stolen its Shards to fuel their power and tighten their rule. Descend into darkness, craft devastating magic, and reclaim the force that once held the world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f776617633966805bde822c054fec7d1.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/f776617633966805bde822c054fec7d1.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>swift Hunter</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>brilliant Mage</strong>, or the\u00a0<strong>unyielding Knight</strong>\u00a0- each with a distinct playstyle that inspires strategic mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shardbreakers evolve, more heroes will rise, unlocking endless possibilities for adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ed28936bafe6ec18bdb0af23323aacec.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ed28936bafe6ec18bdb0af23323aacec.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ed28936bafe6ec18bdb0af23323aacec.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/72a1e1a11e163e7b533ef78a6c9656d0.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/72a1e1a11e163e7b533ef78a6c9656d0.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for relentless, high-speed combat where every second counts.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <strong>uniquely designed enemies</strong>\u00a0with distinct movement, attack patterns, and roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across <strong>hand-built biomes</strong>\u00a0filled with environmental hazards and enemy combinations that push your skills to the edge.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No filler, no breaks - only time to fight, dodge, and break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/2b66f46c80d7a15b1cc0879d466ce778.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/2b66f46c80d7a15b1cc0879d466ce778.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/2b66f46c80d7a15b1cc0879d466ce778.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a9d58e1b4f560ff5a81159e60489fed7.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/a9d58e1b4f560ff5a81159e60489fed7.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim and combine Shards to craft devastating magic. The deeper you descend into darkness, the more chaotic and creative your magic becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/cbe6dc48c29e4c4c4def4b7371fcb0be.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/cbe6dc48c29e4c4c4def4b7371fcb0be.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/cbe6dc48c29e4c4c4def4b7371fcb0be.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/6a0a2ac775f74cec3f34bf868d237061.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/6a0a2ac775f74cec3f34bf868d237061.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is procedurally generated: new enemies, loot, and new builds. Unlock new heroes, expand skill trees, and gain permanent upgrades to grow stronger with every return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/0ac7061766a89649ca95552effc010b7.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/0ac7061766a89649ca95552effc010b7.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/0ac7061766a89649ca95552effc010b7.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR FEEDBACK MATTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback means a lot to us. We\u2019re eager to hear your thoughts and use them to make <i>Shardbreakers</i> the best it can be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist</strong> <i>Shardbreakers</i> now and be part of the journey as we continue developing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256040?t=1768212776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256040?t=1768212776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/b8f7b216de754735fd68d83a980af71a464fc664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768212776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/b8f7b216de754735fd68d83a980af71a464fc664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768212776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/b7acad6e34f7b7ee1d69ba34a8e5ddff.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/b7acad6e34f7b7ee1d69ba34a8e5ddff.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/b7acad6e34f7b7ee1d69ba34a8e5ddff.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shardbreakers</strong></i><strong> is a fast-paced bullet-hell twin-stick action roguelike where you craft your own Magic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Breakers have shattered the First Light - the origin of all creation - and stolen its Shards to fuel their power and tighten their rule. Descend into darkness, craft devastating magic, and reclaim the force that once held the world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f776617633966805bde822c054fec7d1.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/f776617633966805bde822c054fec7d1.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>swift Hunter</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>brilliant Mage</strong>, or the\u00a0<strong>unyielding Knight</strong>\u00a0- each with a distinct playstyle that inspires strategic mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shardbreakers evolve, more heroes will rise, unlocking endless possibilities for adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ed28936bafe6ec18bdb0af23323aacec.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ed28936bafe6ec18bdb0af23323aacec.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ed28936bafe6ec18bdb0af23323aacec.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/72a1e1a11e163e7b533ef78a6c9656d0.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/72a1e1a11e163e7b533ef78a6c9656d0.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for relentless, high-speed combat where every second counts.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <strong>uniquely designed enemies</strong>\u00a0with distinct movement, attack patterns, and roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across <strong>hand-built biomes</strong>\u00a0filled with environmental hazards and enemy combinations that push your skills to the edge.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No filler, no breaks - only time to fight, dodge, and break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/2b66f46c80d7a15b1cc0879d466ce778.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/2b66f46c80d7a15b1cc0879d466ce778.webm?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/2b66f46c80d7a15b1cc0879d466ce778.mp4?t=1768212776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a9d58e1b4f560ff5a81159e60489fed7.avif?t=1768212776\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/a9d58e1b4f560ff5a81159e60489fed7.avif?t=1768212776 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim and combine Shards to craft devastating magic. The deeper you descend into darkness, the more chaotic and creative your magic becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/cbe6dc48c29e4c4c4def4b7371fcb0be.poster.avif?t=1768212776\" width=740 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/cbe6dc48c29e4c4c4def4b7371fcb0